#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:5
msgid "PDF models"
msgstr "Modeli PDF"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:7
msgid ""
"PDF models are provided for several outputs : an invoice model, a receipt "
"model and a membership from model are currently available. All of them "
"inherits from a `Global` model."
msgstr ""
"Za več izhodov so na voljo modeli PDF: trenutno so na voljo model računa, "
"model potrdila in model članstva iz. Vsi podedujejo model »Global«."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:9
msgid "PDF models management"
msgstr "Upravljanje modelov PDF"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:15
msgid "Models inheritance"
msgstr "Dedovanje modelov"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:17
msgid "The global model defines three distinct parts:"
msgstr "Globalni model opredeljuje tri različne dele:"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:19
msgid "header,"
msgstr "glava,"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:20
msgid "footer,"
msgstr "podnožje,"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:21
msgid "CSS styles."
msgstr "Slogi CSS-ja."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:23
msgid ""
"Each model which inherits from `Global` will automatically obtain same "
"header and footer except if the new model redefines them, in which case only "
"specific values will be applied."
msgstr ""
"Vsak model, ki podeduje `Globalno`, bo samodejno pridobil isto glavo in "
"nogo, razen če ju novi model na novo definira, v tem primeru pa bodo "
"uporabljene samo določene vrednosti."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:25
msgid ""
"For CSS properties it is a bit different: `Global` model properties will "
"always be applied, and specific model properties will be appended (just like "
"real CSS stylesheets)."
msgstr ""
"Za lastnosti CSS je nekoliko drugače: vedno bodo uporabljene `globalne` "
"lastnosti modela, specifične lastnosti modela pa bodo dodane (tako kot pri "
"pravih slogovnih predlogah CSS)."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:28
msgid "Generalities"
msgstr "Splošnosti"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:30
msgid ""
"In addition of header, footer and CSS styles, a model defines a title, a sub "
"title and a body."
msgstr ""
"Poleg glave, noge in CSS slogov model definira naslov, podnaslov in telo."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:32
msgid ""
"Each of those fields can take some replacement values, refer to the inline "
"help from the user interface to get details. They also can contains "
"internationalized texts like `_T(\"My text\")` that relies on Galette "
"standard translation capacities."
msgstr ""
"Vsako od teh polj lahko sprejme nekaj nadomestnih vrednosti, za podrobnosti "
"glejte pomoč v uporabniškem vmesniku. Vsebujejo lahko tudi "
"internacionalizirana besedila, kot je `_T(\"Moje besedilo\")`, ki se "
"zanašajo na standardne prevajalske zmogljivosti Galette."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:34
msgid ""
"Models rely on HTML and CSS styles, but keep in mind we are building a PDF "
"file, and not displaying a page in a recent browser; there are many "
"limitations."
msgstr ""
"Modeli se zanašajo na sloge HTML in CSS, vendar ne pozabite, da gradimo "
"datoteko PDF in ne prikazujemo strani v novejšem brskalniku; obstaja veliko "
"omejitev."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:37
msgid "Invoices and receipts"
msgstr "Računi in potrdila"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:39
msgid "Invoice and receipt models are the same, excepting their titles."
msgstr "Vzorca računov in potrdil sta enaka, razen naslovov."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:41
msgid "Invoice PDF model"
msgstr "Model računa v PDF obliki"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:46
msgid ""
"As you can see in the above screenshot, invoice model does not define any "
"header, footer or CSS styles, the ones form the `Global` model are used."
msgstr ""
"Kot lahko vidite na zgornjem posnetku zaslona, model računa ne definira "
"nobenih slogov glave, noge ali CSS, temveč se uporabljajo tisti iz modela "
"`Global`."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:49
msgid "Membership form"
msgstr "Obrazec za članstvo"

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:51
msgid ""
"It is a model that can be used to print a membership form. It can be empty "
"(to print some of them for any event for example) or filled with one member "
"information."
msgstr ""
"To je model, ki ga je mogoče uporabiti za tiskanje obrazca za članstvo. "
"Lahko je prazen (na primer za tiskanje nekaterih obrazcev za kateri koli "
"dogodek) ali pa izpolnjen s podatki o enem članu."

#: ../usermanual/pdf_models.rst:53
msgid ""
"Since there are many limitation, you may use the `FullCard plugin <https://"
"galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-fullcard/>`_ that will replace this model. "
"It is more complex to change, but you can do many more with it. You can also "
"create your own plugin based on FullCard."
msgstr ""
"Ker obstaja veliko omejitev, lahko uporabite vtičnik `FullCard <https://"
"galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-fullcard/>`_, ki bo nadomestil ta model. "
"Spreminjanje je bolj zapleteno, vendar lahko z njim naredite veliko več. "
"Ustvarite lahko tudi svoj vtičnik, ki temelji na FullCard."
